<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Lycée Privé KENNTNIS (LPK) – Établissement d'excellence à Bobo-Dioulasso. Formations générales, techniques et professionnelles."
    />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Lycée Privé KENNTNIS (LPK)" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Excellence académique, technique et professionnelle au service de votre réussite."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0D47A1" />
    <title>Lycée Privé KENNTNIS (LPK)</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css"
      integrity="sha512-0gkQm6t5oYQK1Nxj6PRua7rO9tVj0l4MJPv8U2mk7q0cG1P9r6kQ6S4bXw1D7xYvQ1r5vS9pJ0N4O4g=="
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bleu: #0d47a1;
        --bleu-fonce: #082d66;
        --bleu-clair: #1565c0;
        --rouge: #c62828;
        --rouge-clair: #ef5350;
        --or: #ffd54f;
        --blanc: #ffffff;
        --gris-clair: #f5f7fa;
        --gris-fonce: #4d5366;
        --gris-border: #e9edf2;
        --shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.12);
        --shadow-hover: 0 25px 45px rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.15);
        --radius: 24px;
        --transition: all 0.3s ease;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        background: var(--gris-clair);
        color: #1f2430;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      img {
        max-width: 100%;
        display: block;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      ul {
        list-style: none;
      }

      button,
      input,
      textarea {
        font: inherit;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 90px 0;
      }

      .section--alt {
        background: #edf3f9;
      }

      .section-head {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 0 auto 42px;
      }

      .section-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.1);
        color: var(--bleu);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 8px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .section-title {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
        color: var(--bleu);
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .section-subtitle {
        color: #5d6474;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 14px 30px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: none;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        background: var(--bleu);
        color: var(--blanc);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.22);
        transition: var(--transition);
      }

      .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 28px rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.22);
      }

      .btn--red {
        background: var(--rouge);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(198, 40, 40, 0.2);
      }

      .btn--red:hover {
        box-shadow: 0 18px 28px rgba(198, 40, 40, 0.2);
      }

      .btn--ghost {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--bleu);
        border: 2px solid var(--bleu);
        box-shadow: none;
      }

      .btn--ghost:hover {
        background: var(--bleu);
        color: var(--blanc);
      }

      .navbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 1000;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      }

      .navbar__inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        min-height: 78px;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .brand__logo {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bleu), var(--bleu-clair));
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: var(--blanc);
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        position: relative;
      }

      .brand__logo::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        width: 14px;
        height: 14px;
        background: var(--rouge);
        border: 2px solid var(--blanc);
        border-radius: 50%;
        top: -4px;
        right: -4px;
      }

      .brand__text {
        color: var(--bleu);
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .brand__text small {
        display: block;
        color: #697180;
        font-size: 0.55rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .brand__text strong {
        color: var(--rouge);
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 26px;
      }

      .nav a {
        position: relative;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #2a3241;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .nav a::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        bottom: -8px;
        width: 0;
        height: 2.5px;
        background: var(--rouge);
        transition: width 0.25s ease;
      }

      .nav a:hover::after,
      .nav a:focus-visible::after {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .nav__cta {
        padding: 10px 18px;
        background: var(--rouge);
        color: var(--blanc) !important;
        border-radius: 999px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(198, 40, 40, 0.22);
      }

      .nav__cta::after {
        display: none !important;
      }

      .nav-toggle {
        display: none;
        border: none;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--bleu);
        font-size: 1.7rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .hero {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #081f4d 0%, #0d47a1 50%, #1565c0 100%);
        color: var(--blanc);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .hero::before,
      .hero::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      }

      .hero::before {
        width: 520px;
        height: 520px;
        right: -120px;
        top: -180px;
      }

      .hero::after {
        width: 420px;
        height: 420px;
        left: -80px;
        bottom: -180px;
      }

      .hero__inner {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 40px;
        min-height: 700px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .hero__content {
        max-width: 700px;
      }

      .hero__badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 8px 18px;
        color: var(--or);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .hero__title {
        font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.4rem);
        line-height: 1.08;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .hero__title span {
        color: var(--or);
      }

      .hero__subtitle {
        font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .hero__text {
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.83);
        max-width: 620px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .hero__actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      .hero__stats {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 30px;
      }

      .stat {
        min-width: 140px;
      }

      .stat__value {
        display: block;
        font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .stat__label {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .hero__card {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        border-radius: 28px;
        padding: 26px;
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .hero-card__row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
        padding-bottom: 14px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .hero-card__title {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .hero-card__badge {
        background: rgba(255, 213, 79, 0.12);
        color: var(--or);
        padding: 6px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .hero-card__list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 14px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      }

      .hero-card__list li {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .hero-card__list i {
        color: var(--or);
        margin-top: 3px;
      }

      .why-grid,
      .formations-grid,
      .engagements-grid,
      .team-grid,
      .news-grid,
      .footer-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 28px;
      }

      .why-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      }

      .why-card,
      .formation-card,
      .engagement-item,
      .team-card,
      .news-card,
      .contact-box,
      .contact-form {
        background: var(--blanc);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .why-card {
        padding: 26px 20px;
        text-align: center;
        transition: var(--transition);
        border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;
      }

      .why-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-10px);
        border-bottom-color: var(--rouge);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      }

      .why-card i {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 2.6rem;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bleu), var(--bleu-clair));
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }

      .why-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .why-card p {
        color: #5d6474;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .formations-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      }

      .formation-card {
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: var(--transition);
      }

      .formation-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-8px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      }

      .formation-card__header {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        min-height: 150px;
        color: var(--blanc);
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .formation-card__header span {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-top: 6px;
        opacity: 0.9;
      }

      .formation-card__header--general {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d47a1, #1e88e5);
      }

      .formation-card__header--technique {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #af1111, #ef5350);
      }

      .formation-card__header--professionnel {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b5e20, #43a047);
      }

      .formation-card__body {
        padding: 28px 26px 30px;
      }

      .formation-card__body h3 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        color: var(--bleu);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .pill {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--rouge);
        color: var(--blanc);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 5px 12px;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .formation-card__body ul {
        list-style: disc;
        padding-left: 18px;
        margin: 12px 0 18px;
        color: #3b4451;
      }

      .formation-card__body li {
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .formation-card__meta {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px 12px;
        background: var(--gris-clair);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        color: #404a59;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }

      .formation-card__meta i {
        color: var(--bleu);
      }

      .admissions-wrap {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 0 auto 30px;
        background: var(--blanc);
        border-radius: 28px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        padding: 38px 36px;
      }

      .admissions-wrap ul {
        list-style: disc;
        padding-left: 18px;
        color: #2a3241;
        line-height: 2;
      }

      .admissions-wrap strong {
        color: var(--bleu);
      }

      .admissions-actions {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 26px;
      }

      .apropos-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 0.92fr;
        gap: 36px;
      }

      .apropos-copy p {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        color: #2e3745;
        font-size: 1.02rem;
      }

      .tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .tags span {
        background: var(--bleu);
        color: var(--blanc);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 7px 18px;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .engagements-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
        margin-top: 26px;
      }

      .engagement-item {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 18px 12px;
        transition: var(--transition);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #2a3241;
      }

      .engagement-item:hover {
        background: var(--bleu);
        color: var(--blanc);
        transform: translateY(-4px);
      }

      .team-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      }

      .team-card {
        padding: 28px 20px 22px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 4px solid var(--rouge);
        transition: var(--transition);
      }

      .team-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      }

      .team-card i {
        font-size: 2.7rem;
        color: var(--bleu);
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .team-card h4 {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #1d2430;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .team-card p {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: #697180;
      }

      .gallery-filters {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .gallery-filters button {
        border: none;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        background: var(--blanc);
        color: #2a3241;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: var(--transition);
      }

      .gallery-filters button.is-active,
      .gallery-filters button:hover {
        background: var(--bleu);
        color: var(--blanc);
      }

      .gallery-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .gallery-item {
        min-height: 180px;
        border-radius: 24px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 18px;
        color: var(--blanc);
        font-weight: 700;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        transition: var(--transition);
      }

      .gallery-item:hover {
        transform: scale(1.03);
      }

      .gallery-item i {
        display: block;
        font-size: 2.6rem;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .gallery-item[data-category='salle'] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d47a1, #42a5f5); }
      .gallery-item[data-category='tp'] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b71c1c, #ef5350); }
      .gallery-item[data-category='labo'] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b5e20, #66bb6a); }
      .gallery-item[data-category='eleves'] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e65100, #ffb74d); }
      .gallery-item[data-category='activites'] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a148c, #ab47bc); }
      .gallery-item[data-category='examens'] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00695c, #26a69a); }
      .gallery-item[data-category='diplomes'] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3e2723, #8d6e63); }
      .gallery-item[data-category='culture'] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #bf360c, #ff7043); }

      .gallery-item.hidden {
        display: none;
      }

      .news-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr));
      }

      .news-card {
        padding: 28px 24px;
        transition: var(--transition);
      }

      .news-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-8px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      }

      .news-card__date {
        color: var(--rouge);
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .news-card h3 {
        margin: 12px 0 10px;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: var(--bleu);
      }

      .news-card p {
        color: #5b6471;
      }

      .contact-wrap {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 30px;
      }

      .contact-box,
      .contact-form {
        padding: 34px 28px;
      }

      .contact-box p {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        color: #384151;
      }

      .contact-box i {
        width: 28px;
        color: var(--bleu);
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      .map {
        margin-top: 24px;
        min-height: 190px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e5ecf4, #d0d9e4);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #475467;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .contact-form form {
        display: grid;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .contact-form input,
      .contact-form textarea {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 15px 18px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: 2px solid var(--gris-border);
        background: var(--blanc);
        color: #1d2430;
        transition: var(--transition);
      }

      .contact-form input:focus,
      .contact-form textarea:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: var(--bleu);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.08);
      }

      .contact-form textarea {
        resize: vertical;
        min-height: 140px;
      }

      .form-status {
        min-height: 24px;
        color: var(--rouge);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .floating-actions {
        position: fixed;
        right: 28px;
        bottom: 28px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
        z-index: 999;
      }

      .floating-actions a {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: var(--blanc);
        box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        transition: var(--transition);
      }

      .floating-actions a:hover {
        transform: scale(1.08);
      }

      .floating-actions .whatsapp {
        background: #25d366;
      }

      .floating-actions .phone {
        background: var(--bleu);
      }

      .back-top {
        position: fixed;
        right: 30px;
        bottom: 108px;
        width: 46px;
        height: 46px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--bleu);
        color: var(--blanc);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.2);
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        transform: translateY(12px);
        transition: var(--transition);
        z-index: 998;
      }

      .back-top.show {
        opacity: 1;
        visibility: visible;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      .footer {
        background: #091827;
        color: #c7d3e4;
        padding: 70px 0 20px;
      }

      .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
        margin-bottom: 34px;
      }

      .footer-grid h4 {
        color: var(--blanc);
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .footer-grid a,
      .footer-grid p {
        color: #bdd0e8;
        line-height: 2;
      }

      .footer-logo {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .footer-logo .brand__logo {
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
      }

      .footer-logo .brand__text {
        color: var(--blanc);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .footer-social {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .footer-social a {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      }

      .footer-bottom {
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
        padding-top: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #9aa8ba;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      .reveal {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(26px);
        transition: all 0.8s ease;
      }

      .reveal.is-visible {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      @media (max-width: 980px) {
        .hero__inner,
        .apropos-grid,
        .contact-wrap {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 780px) {
        .nav-toggle {
          display: block;
        }

        .nav {
          position: absolute;
          top: 100%;
          left: 0;
          right: 0;
          display: none;
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: stretch;
          gap: 18px;
          padding: 18px 18px 22px;
          background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
          border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.08);
          box-shadow: 0 18px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .nav.is-open {
          display: flex;
        }

        .nav a {
          display: block;
          padding: 4px 0;
        }

        .hero__inner {
          min-height: 620px;
          padding: 40px 0 60px;
        }

        .hero__actions {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .hero__actions .btn {
          width: 100%;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .section {
          padding: 72px 0;
        }

        .admissions-wrap,
        .contact-box,
        .contact-form {
          padding: 24px 18px;
        }

        .floating-actions {
          right: 18px;
          bottom: 18px;
        }

        .back-top {
          right: 18px;
          bottom: 90px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="navbar">
      <div class="container navbar__inner">
        <a class="brand" href="#accueil" aria-label="Accueil">
          <div class="brand__logo">LPK</div>
          <div class="brand__text">
            KENNTNIS <strong>▪</strong>
            <small>Lycée Privé Conventionné</small>
          </div>
        </a>

        <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Ouvrir le menu" aria-expanded="false">
          <i class="fas fa-bars"></i>
        </button>

        <nav class="nav" id="navMenu" aria-label="Navigation principale">
          <a href="#accueil">Accueil</a>
          <a href="#formations">Formations</a>
          <a href="#admissions">Admissions</a>
          <a href="#apropos">À propos</a>
          <a href="#galerie">Galerie</a>
          <a href="#actualites">Actualités</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
          <a href="#admissions" class="nav__cta">S'inscrire</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" id="accueil">
        <div class="container hero__inner">
          <div class="hero__content reveal">
            <div class="hero__badge"><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i> Année scolaire 2026 – 2027</div>
            <h1 class="hero__title">Lycée Privé <span>KENNTNIS</span></h1>
            <p class="hero__subtitle">Établissement Privé Conventionné d’Enseignement Général, Technique &amp; Professionnel</p>
            <p class="hero__text">
              Préparez votre avenir grâce à un enseignement d’excellence, un encadrement rigoureux et des formations
              adaptées aux exigences du supérieur et du monde professionnel.
            </p>

            <div class="hero__actions">
              <a href="#formations" class="btn">Découvrir nos formations</a>
              <a href="#admissions" class="btn btn--red">S'inscrire maintenant</a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero__stats">
              <div class="stat">
                <span class="stat__value">10+</span>
                <span class="stat__label">Filières</span>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <span class="stat__value">95%</span>
                <span class="stat__label">Réussite</span>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <span class="stat__value">50+</span>
                <span class="stat__label">Enseignants</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero__card reveal">
            <div class="hero-card__row">
              <div class="hero-card__title">Le LPK en chiffres</div>
              <span class="hero-card__badge">2026</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="hero-card__list">
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <span>Un environnement propice à la réussite académique et professionnelle.</span></li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <span>Une pédagogie active, moderne et centrée sur l’élève.</span></li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <span>Un accompagnement personnalisé dès l’entrée au lycée.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head reveal">
            <span class="section-badge">Pourquoi nous choisir</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Une éducation qui construit l’avenir</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="why-grid">
            <article class="why-card reveal">
              <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i>
              <h3>Excellence académique</h3>
              <p>Un cadre pédagogique structuré pour favoriser la réussite et la confiance en soi.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="why-card reveal">
              <i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i>
              <h3>Encadrement expert</h3>
              <p>Des enseignants expérimentés qui accompagnent chaque élève pas à pas.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="why-card reveal">
              <i class="fas fa-tools"></i>
              <h3>Formations pratiques</h3>
              <p>Des compétences utiles pour l’université, le monde du travail et l’entrepreneuriat.</p>
